@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1
@rootUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@contentType = application/json

# API DOCS

### Swagger UI
GET {{rootUrl}}/api/docs/

### OpenAPI schema
GET {{rootUrl}}/api/schema/


# PRODUCTS

### List products
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/

### Product detail by slug
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/iphone-17-pro/

### Filter by category
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/?category=iphone

### Search by product text and variant attributes
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/?search=iPhone

### Filter by model name
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/?model=iPhone%2015%20Pro

### Filter by variant fields
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/?color=Silver&storage=256GB&min_price=40000&max_price=70000&in_stock=true

### Filter by RAM and SIM attributes
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/?ram=8GB&sim=eSIM

### Filter by dynamic attributes
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/?attr_chip=A19%20Pro

### Sort by lowest variant price
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/?ordering=price

### Sort by newest products
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/?ordering=-created_at


# VARIANT CARDS

### List variants as separate catalog cards
GET {{baseUrl}}/variants/

### List new variant cards
GET {{baseUrl}}/variants/?is_new=true

### Variant detail by slug
GET {{baseUrl}}/variants/iphone-17-pro-max-256gb-cosmic-orange/

### Filter variant cards by model
GET {{baseUrl}}/variants/?category=iphone&model=iPhone%2017%20Pro%20Max

### Filter variant cards by color and storage
GET {{baseUrl}}/variants/?category=iphone&color=Cosmic%20Orange&storage=256GB

### Filter variant cards by RAM and SIM
GET {{baseUrl}}/variants/?category=iphone&ram=12GB&sim=eSIM

### Sort variant cards by lowest price
GET {{baseUrl}}/variants/?category=iphone&ordering=price
